OL,3,GNEWSAComic artist caught in air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol chaos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA co-creator of The Walking Dead comic
OL,7,Fbooks has claimed British Airways cut
OL,8,Foff its phone lines amid a UK-wide air
OL,9,Ftraffic control issue, which has led to
OL,10,Fhundreds of flight cancellations.
OL,12,FCharlie Adlard, 60, from Shrewsbury,
OL,13,Fwas due to fly to a comic book
OL,14,Fconvention in Palermo, Sicily, from
OL,15,FLondon Heathrow on Wednesday, when his
OL,16,Fflight was cancelled.
OL,18,FHe said he was told the airline had
OL,19,F"taken their phone off the hook so you
OL,20,Fcan't even phone customer service
OL,21,Fanymore," due to the number of people
OL,22,Ftrying to get through.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
