OL,4,Acontrol chaos
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Airways said the technical
OL,7,Fissue would have a "significant
OL,8,Fknock-on impact for customers and
OL,9,Fcolleagues" and its call centres were
OL,10,F"incredibly busy".
